<%- include('../partials/head',{title:'Compatibility Results'}) %><%- include('../partials/nav') %>
<div class="container"><div class="page-header"><div><span class="eyebrow-label">Your results</span><h4>Choose the strand that fits your direction</h4><p>Compatibility reflects your RIASEC answers. The final choice is always yours.</p></div></div><%- include('_steps',{current:3}) %>
<div class="recommendation-banner"><div class="recommendation-emblem"><i class="bi bi-stars"></i></div><div><small>Strongest compatibility</small><h3><%=recommended%> · <%=percentages[recommended]%>%</h3><p>Your answers show the strongest signal for <%=recommended%>. Review every option before continuing.</p></div></div>
<form method="post" action="/enroll/strand"><div class="results-layout"><div><div class="section-heading"><div><h5>Compare all strands</h5><p>Select one option to continue.</p></div><span>RIASEC-based</span></div><%ranked.forEach((s,i)=>{%><label class="result-choice <%=s===recommended?'is-top':''%>"><input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="strand" value="<%=s%>" <%=s===recommended?'checked':''%> required><span class="result-rank"><%=i+1%></span><span class="result-main"><span><strong><%=s%></strong><%if(s===recommended){%><em>Recommended</em><%}%></span><span class="compatibility-meter"><span style="width:<%=percentages[s]%>%"></span></span></span><span class="result-score"><strong><%=percentages[s]%>%</strong><small>match</small></span></label><%})%></div><aside class="decision-panel"><div class="decision-icon"><i class="bi bi-lightbulb"></i></div><h5>How to decide</h5><p>Use the score as one input. Think about the subjects you enjoy, the skills you want to build, and your plans after SHS.</p><ul><li>Your recommendation is not mandatory.</li><li>You can discuss the result with a teacher or guardian.</li><li>Your selected strand determines the elective list.</li></ul><button class="btn btn-primary w-100">Continue to electives <i class="bi bi-arrow-right ms-1"></i></button></aside></div></form></div><%- include('../partials/foot') %>
